---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SearchVisualizer from '../../../components/algorithms/SearchVisualizer.vue';
---

<BaseLayout title="线性查找动画演示 - Demo Center" description="线性查找算法可视化演示：逐个遍历数组元素，比较是否等于目标值，Java 代码同步高亮">
  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-10">
    <a href="${baseUrl}algorithms" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-accent-dark dark:text-accent hover:underline mb-6">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
      返回算法列表
    </a>

    <header class="mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <span class="text-3xl">🔍</span>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">线性查找</h1>
          <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Linear Search · 逐个遍历，简单直接</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">无需有序</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400">O(n)</span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">O(1) 空间</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <SearchVisualizer client:load algorithm="linear" initialArray={[4, 2, 8, 5, 1, 9, 3, 7]} target={5} />

    <section class="mt-12 space-y-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">核心思想</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          从数组的第一个元素开始，依次将每个元素与目标值进行比较。如果找到相等的元素，立即返回其下标；如果遍历完整个数组都没找到，则返回 -1。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">复杂度分析</h2>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-sm text-left">
            <thead class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50">
              <tr>
                <th class="px-4 py-2 rounded-l-lg">情况</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2">时间复杂度</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2 rounded-r-lg">说明</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300">
              <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                <td class="px-4 py-3">最优</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono font-bold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">O(1)</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">目标值恰好是第一个元素</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-slate-800">
                <td class="px-4 py-3">平均 / 最差</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">O(n)</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">需要遍历大部分或全部元素</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">空间</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">O(1)</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">只需一个循环变量</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/40">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">适用场景</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400 space-y-1">
          <li>数据量较小，或查找次数很少</li>
          <li>数组<strong>没有排序</strong>，不方便使用二分查找</li>
          <li>链表等不支持随机访问的数据结构</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
